  "mapping": "Base 7 seconds * 20 TPS = 140 ticks. Weapon final blow activates/refreshes damage * 1.3, Range +10, recovery/cadence * 1.2. No Hand Cannon in exact pool; no charge/draw APIs. Stow removes live buff. Cadence snapshot changes no raw damage; validated paid token snapshot is sole damage multiplier.",
  "localPolicies": "Paid capture is trusted integration boundary; capture BEFORE kills, after payment. Actual eligible final blow and positive HP/absorption loss required. Original owner/player/level/data/runtime/class/stack/hotbar-slot/loadout-mode/roll revalidated; edits/loss/lifecycle revoke epochs. Corpse identity ledger capped at 256 per emission, fail closed without eviction. Stow/expiry preserve paid damage snapshot. Stowed kills dedup but do not bank a buff. Queries pure. Same-tick accepted stow suppresses held benefits through that tick. Shared range sums bonuses before one 0..100 clamp/raw hip endpoints then ADS. Canis has no Range stat and zero range slopes; Range+10 gives no invented projectile travel or blast change.",
